        "original_id": "8f5d4e5e-6169-5a2e-b96d-301242589c84",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bebe Rexha, David Guetta, Nicki Minaj, Afrojack, G-Eazy, Martin Garrix\n- Songs: \"Me, Myself & I\", \"Hey Mama\", \"In the Name of Love\", \"Take Me Home\"\n- Music Releases: I Don't Wanna Grow Up\n- Topics: Billboard Hot 100, featured guest vocals, debut EPs\n\nFacts:\n- I Don't Wanna Grow Up is the debut EP by American pop recording artist Bebe Rexha.\n- Bebe Rexha is best known as a featured guest vocalist on Billboard Hot 100 charting songs including G-Eazy's \"Me, Myself & I\", David Guetta's \"Hey Mama\", Martin Garrix's \"In the Name of Love\", and Cash Cash's \"Take Me Home\".\n- \"Hey Mama\" is a song by French DJ and record producer David Guetta featuring vocals from Nicki Minaj and Bebe Rexha, with production from Afrojack.",
